+# qos.dem — Story 3.1 golden: two packet types flowing. Era 3 demand
+# (email 4/tick res->res + streaming 2/tick host->res) spawns via the
+# scripted_plan_pressure director with seeded weighted-random (class, src, dst)
+# picks; the streaming_surge set-piece (x10, window [60s, 150s)) is live from
+# 60s. The T1 hash manifest + the T2 captures pin the era-3 run bit-for-bit;
+# pixel fidelity of the render is deferred per the rlsw-harness gap.
+# fixture qos = the 3-node fixture + residentials 3,4 (so the email spec has a
+# real sink set). Node ids: 0=res, 1=router, 2=host, 3=res, 4=res.
+seed 3003
+run 75000ms
+era 3
+fixture qos
+at 100ms draw 0 1 standard
+at 100ms draw 1 2 standard
+at 100ms draw 3 1 standard
+at 100ms draw 4 1 standard
+capture at 1000ms
+capture at 65000ms
